<title>NORWAY: Oslo bourse puts Nycomed on observation list.</title>
<headline>Oslo bourse puts Nycomed on observation list.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Oslo bourse said on Tuesday it had transferred Norwegian pharmaceuticals company Nycomed ASA to an observation list following an announcement of a planned merger with Britain's Amersham International Plc.</p>
<p>The bourse often transfers stocks to a special list for close monitoring in times of extraordinary events such as mergers and profit warnings.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
